HISTORY except for the settings mentioned above.                                HISTORY fuv_G140L1280_orbit_disp.fits renamed to v3g18194l_disp.fits on Mar 16 2HISTORY 0                                                                       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY  ----------------------- C1222 Update -LP1-------------------------     HISTORY Visit 03 of Project 12505 took spectra of the central star of the       HISTORY Planetary Nebulae NGC3132, "The Southern Ring". An H2 model was         HISTORY applied to obtain the wavelength solution FUVB. For FUVA, the           HISTORY normal interstellar lines were used.  This version of the disptab       HISTORY is designed to be used with the LAMPTAB file derived for use at         HISTORY original lifetime position.  To correct for any initial pointing        HISTORY error of 12505, difference due to focus position and to shift the       HISTORY dispersion solution to the second postion, the following zero           HISTORY point offsets were applied to produce the values used for C1222 in      HISTORY this file: FUVA = -17.4p, FUVB= +1.7p.                                  HISTORY FUV[A,B] files :                                                        HISTORY lbsk03vgq_rawtag_[a,b].fits                                             HISTORY lbsk03viq_rawtag_[a,b].fits                                             HISTORY lbsk03vkq_rawtag_[a,b].fits                                             HISTORY lbsk03vmq_rawtag_[a,b].fits                                             HISTORY bm_l1_gm2_disp.fits renamed to x1v17415l_disp.fits on Jan 31 2013       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY  -------------------- C1055/C1096 Update LP2 ----------------------     HISTORY To determine the dispersion solutions for C1055 and C1096 the           HISTORY following process was applied. For FUVA, the C1055A and C1096A          HISTORY spectra of AzV75 (13070) were compared to the COS C1222 FUVB            HISTORY processed spectrum. This comparison was performed for the full          HISTORY overlap region in wavelength space between C1222B and C1096/55A.        HISTORY The dispersion solution was updated in both zero_point and              HISTORY dispersion as determined by the correlations in the IDL program         HISTORY written by SVP in the repository as measure_lp2offset_bm.pro. This      HISTORY process was repeated until the dispersion solution converged onto       HISTORY the best solution. The history of these updates is captured in the      HISTORY IDL .pro file used to recreate the updating reference files (in         HISTORY the repository as convert_bm_lp1_to_lp2_disp.pro). Data processed       HISTORY with this solution was then compared by Paule Sonnentrucker to a        HISTORY model spectrum of AzV75. This comparison used careful                   HISTORY cross-correlations of the ISM lines only. This comparison was used      HISTORY to adjust the zero-point offset to its final solution. The              HISTORY identical process was used for C1055/96B, except that the               HISTORY reference spectrum was a FUSE spectrum supplied by C. Oliveira (in      HISTORY the repository as AzV75_P1150404_nvo.dat).                              HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The following files were used in creating the dispersion solutions      HISTORY for C1055, C1096 and C1222B (lc3n01020, lc3n01030, and lc3n01010).      HISTORY C1096:  LC3N01TRQ, LC3N01TTQ, LC3N01TVQ, LC3N01TXQ                      HISTORY C1055:  LC3N01TFQ, LC3N01THQ, LC3N01TMQ, LC3N01TPQ                      HISTORY C1222:  LC3N01T5Q, LC3N01T7Q, LC3N01T9Q, LC3N01TBQ                      HISTORY This file should replace x1v17415l in CDBS.                             HISTORY Headers modified by update_bm_headers.py, rev 265.                      HISTORY bm_l2_1055_1096_gm1_disp.fits renamed to x6q17584l_disp.fits on Jun 26 2HISTORY 013                                                                     HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY --Oct. 09 2013--                                                        HISTORY Generated by script: make_disptab.py                                    HISTORY SVN revision: 387                                                       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY Updated G140L/1230/FUVB and G140L/1280/FUVB central wavelength settings HISTORY using refined dispersion relation from MRK-509 and WD0947+857 datasets  HISTORY to date from PROPOSIDs: 12916, 11897, 12424, 12715, 12806.              HISTORY BOA coefficients are copied from the PSA.                               HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY D column for 1280/BOA FUVA and FUVB set to -231.6058 to reflect past    HISTORY changes made to PSA but never updated for BOA.                          HISTORY new_disp.fits renamed to xaa18189l_disp.fits on Oct 10 2013             HISTORY --------------------May 02 2016--------------------                     HISTORY Updates to FUV linear dispersion values.                                HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The FUV dispersions solutions are now lifetime dependent.               HISTORY "LIFE_ADJ" header keyword added to account for that.                    HISTORY Updated LP1/G130M/1291/1300/1309/1318/1327 PSA linear disp relations:   HISTORY zero points and linear dispersion coefficients                          HISTORY Updated LP1/G160M/1577/1589/1600/1611/1623 PSA linear disp relations:   HISTORY zero points and linear dispersion coefficients                          HISTORY The linear dispersion coefficients are based on the COS raytrace model, HISTORY scaled to match dispersion coefficients derived by cross-correlating    HISTORY COS and STIS data for each target.                                      HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The D column and D_TV03 columns were absorbed into the new zero points. HISTORY These column values are 0 for all PSA dispersions that were modified.   HISTORY G130M/1055/1096/1222 PSA values were copied from xaa18189l_disp.fits    HISTORY WCA and BOA values were also copied from xaa18189l_disp.fits            HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY More information about how the updated dispersion solutions were derivedHISTORY can be found in the May 2016 COS STAN.                                  HISTORY deliver_wavelp1_disp.fits renamed to 0551654nl_disp.fits on May 5 2016  HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY --------------------May 18 2016--------------------                     HISTORY Updates to FUV linear G160M dispersion values.                          HISTORY Values in 0561933ml_disp.fits for G160M were based on COS-to-STIS       HISTORY cross-correlations. Dispersions are now based on the raytrace model.    HISTORY lp1_delivered_05_18_v17_disp.fits renamed to 05i1639ml_disp.fits on May HISTORY 18 2016                                                                 HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY --------------------April 28 2017--------------------                   HISTORY Preliminary updates for LP4.                                            HISTORY Identical to 05i1639ml_disp.fits except LIFE_ADJ=4                      HISTORY It is more accurate to use a copy of the updated LP1 dispersion solutionHISTORY at the beginning of LP4 than xaa18189l_disp.fits.                       HISTORY lp4_disp.fits renamed to 1511947tl_disp.fits on May 1 2017              HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY 2017/07/27                                                              HISTORY This file is identical to 1511947tl_disp.fits, except that rows         HISTORY have been added for G130M/1223. These rows are identical to G130M/1222. HISTORY jo1223_disp.fits renamed to 1811505pl_disp.fits on Aug 1 2017           HISTORY 1811505pl_disp.fits renamed to 18118285l_disp.fits on Aug 1 2017        HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY --------------------March 12 2018--------------------                   HISTORY Cenwave 1223 has been removed as it will not be supported at this time. HISTORY 1223_removed_disp.fits renamed to 23n1744hl_disp.fits on Mar 23 2018    HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY --------------------April 06 2018--------------------                   HISTORY Updates to FUV linear dispersion values.                                HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The FUV dispersions solutions are now lifetime dependent.               HISTORY "LIFE_ADJ" header keyword added to account for that.                    HISTORY Updated LP4/G130M/1222/1291/1300/1309/1318/1327 PSA linear disp         HISTORY relations: zero points and linear dispersion coefficients               HISTORY Updated LP4/G160M/1577/1589/1600/1611/1623 PSA linear disp relations:   HISTORY zero points and linear dispersion coefficients                          HISTORY For all above modes except G130M/1222, the linear dispersion            HISTORY coefficients are based on the COS raytrace model, as well as COS        HISTORY absolute focus values, scaled to match dispersion coefficients          HISTORY derived by cross-correlating COS and STIS data for each target          HISTORY using data from PIDs 15365, 14842, and 15366.                           HISTORY For G130M/1222/FUVA the linear dispersion coefficients are purely       HISTORY from the COS and STIS cross-correlation.                                HISTORY For G130M/1222/FUVB the linear dispersion coefficients are derived      HISTORY by cross-correlating COS data from PID 15365 to an emission line        HISTORY model of Eps-Eri.                                                       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The D column and D_TV03 columns were absorbed into the new zero points. HISTORY These column values are 0 where the linear dispersions were updated.    HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY G130M/FUVB 1300/1309/1318/1327 FUVB modes are not supported at LP4.     HISTORY G130M/1291/1327 FUVB zero points were derived using the method above    HISTORY because data at these modes existed.                                    HISTORY G130M/1300/1309/1318 FUVB zero points were modified from LP3 due to the HISTORY lack of data at these modes, and the "D" column was set to 0.           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY For all updated modes, the BOA values were copied from the PSA.         HISTORY G130M/1055/1096, G140L/1230 values were copied from 23n1744hl_disp.fits HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY A change in the zero point due to the creation of a new LAMPTAB at LP4  HISTORY required updating the "D" column for G140L/1105/1280 PSA and BOA modes. HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY lp4_delivery_disp.fits renamed to 24915196l_disp.fits on Apr 9 2018     HISTORY --------------------- November 2018 --------------------------          HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY This LP4 DISPTAB now includes rows for G160M/1533 and G140L/800.        HISTORY G160M/1533 and G140L/800 entries were created and tested using codes    HISTORY listed in the COS grit repository.                                      HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY It was created using data from PID 15457 for G160M/1533 and 15451       HISTORY for G140L/800. For c1533 PSA, coefficients are derived via              HISTORY cross-correlation of a c1533 spectrum of Eps Eri with high-quality      HISTORY STIS E140M data. For c800 PSA/FUVA, coefficients are derived via        HISTORY cross-correlation of a c800 spectrum of AV 75 with FUSE and STIS data.  HISTORY For c800 PSA/FUVB (not used), coefficients are copied from FUVA,        HISTORY except the zero point is set to -660 A. All BOA rows are copies         HISTORY of corresponding PSA rows. For WCA rows, zero points are copied         HISTORY from corresponding PSA rows, and higher-order terms are copied          HISTORY from corresponding WCA rows of c1105 (for c800) or c1577 (for c1533).   HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY G160M/1533 parameters derived by A. Fox.                                HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY G140L/800 parameters derived by W. Fischer.                             HISTORY new_cenwaves_disp.fits renamed to 2bj2256ml_disp.fits on Nov 19 2018    HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY --------------------September 08 2021--------------------               HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY Dispersion values were derived using the same methodology established   HISTORY in the 2016 effort for LP5 using data from PIDs 16468 and 16467.        HISTORY The following modes were updated:                                       HISTORY FUVA G130M/1291/1300/1309/1318/1327 PSA and FUVB G130M/1291 PSA         HISTORY No other modes will be used at LP5.                                     HISTORY All other rows are identical to the LP4 file: 2bj2256ml_disp.fits.      HISTORY However, the "D" column in the FUVB G130M/1300/1309/1318/1327 rows      HISTORY were updated with the associated LP5 LAMPTAB values.                    HISTORY For all updated modes, the BOA values were copied from the PSA.         HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY wavelp5_v9_disp.fits renamed to 5992009ol_disp.fits on Sep 9 2021       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY --------------------March 12 2025--------------------                   HISTORY This file was created as part of the FUV recalibration effort following HISTORY the delivery of new GEOFILE, DGEOFILE, XWLKFILE, and YWLKFILE reference HISTORY files in 2023-24.                                                       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY This DISPTAB includes updated LP5 dispersion coefficients for cenwaves: HISTORY G130M FUVA c1291, c1300, c1309, c1318, c1327                            HISTORY G130M FUVB c1291                                                        HISTORY The new coefficients apply to the PSA only.                             HISTORY Coefficients for all other LP5 modes and the WCA and BOA have been      HISTORY copied from the previous DISPTAB: 5992009ol_disp.fits                   HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The data and methods used to create this file largely follow            HISTORY Plesha 2022, and are described in detail in French et al. 2025.         HISTORY All data were processed with the new GEOFILE, DGEOFILE, XWLKFILE,       HISTORY and YWLKFILE.                                                           